### Pay-in: first callback fails verification, then retry succeeds
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":12.50,"currency":"USD","scenario":"bad-signature"}

### Duplicate notifications
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":12.50,"currency":"USD","scenario":"duplicate:3"}

### Payout with reversed notifications
POST {{baseUrl}}/payout
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":10.00,"currency":"USD","bankCode":"DEMO","accountNo":"00001234","accountName":"Sample Person","scenario":"out-of-order"}

